  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dragonfly_chatbot",
      "text": "An independent DeepSeek Harness support agent for **Dragonfly 3D World** built-in\nfeatures. It searches official help and, when available, official Python files in the\nuser's own Dragonfly installation. It does not claim vendor endorsement."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires Node.js >=22.19 and DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.2.\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin add github:howpy/dragonfly_chatbot#v0.2.0\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "At first activation the agent checks the computer for Dragonfly. Windows discovery\nchecks uninstall registry entries, standard installation locations, product folders\nat drive roots and PATH. DRAGONFLY_ROOT / DRAGONFLY_HOME and the `dragonflyPath`\nconfiguration field support custom locations. Detection validates the executable and\nproduct directory structure; it never launches Dragonfly or scans entire drives.\nLinux/macOS location discovery is best effort and has not been tested on those systems."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "**No Dragonfly found:** help-only mode remains fully usable. The agent states this\nin its first Dragonfly answer and every tool response. Run `dragonfly-chatbot doctor`\nfor a direct report. Reload the plugin after installing Dragonfly or changing paths."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "**Dragonfly found:** help search defaults to its detected version; official Python\nsource is searched in place only when the source tool is called. Multiple versions\nremain separate. Unknown or unsupported versions are reported without silently\nsubstituting documentation. You may explicitly request another documented version."
    },
    {
      "section": "Evidence and data",
      "text": "The package contains 525 English help pages for Dragonfly 2027.1.\nChinese queries use bilingual term expansion; answers can be in either language.\nHelp citations refer to extracted text lines, not original HTML line numbers.\nOfficial notices are retained. See [NOTICE.md](NOTICE.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Evidence and data",
      "text": "No Dragonfly implementation source, binaries, user extensions or installed Python\npackages are distributed. Only the agent's own code and extracted help text ship.\nLocal source is read from `python/OrsPythonPlugins`, `ORSServiceClass`, `OrsHelpers`,\n`OrsLibraries` and `ORSModel`; no persistent source index or source export is created.\nFiles outside these roots, symlinks, settings and credentials are excluded. Compiled\nimplementations cannot be inspected. Searches have file/byte budgets and report when\ntruncated; no hit is not proof that an API does not exist."
    },
    {
      "section": "Evidence and data",
      "text": "Evidence returned to Harness enters the configured model context and may be sent to\nits model provider. Retrieval is deterministic; answer quality also depends on the LLM."
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools and configuration",
      "text": "- `search_dragonfly_knowledge`: version-filtered help search.\n- `search_dragonfly_source`: bounded read-only local Python search.\n- `read_dragonfly_evidence`: read an ID returned by either search.\n- `get_dragonfly_corpus_status`: environment, paths, versions and help coverage."
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools and configuration",
      "text": "Configuration: `dragonflyPath` (optional product root/executable), `helpCorpusFile`\n(optional additional help-only JSON), `maxResults` (1–20, default 8). Configure these\non the `dragonfly-chatbot` row in your Harness profile.\n\n```sh\ndragonfly-chatbot doctor\ndragonfly-chatbot doctor --dragonfly-path \"D:/Dragonfly2027.1\"\ndragonfly-chatbot search --query \"threshold segmentation\" --version 2027.1\ndragonfly-chatbot source --query \"Channel\" --version 2027.1"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools and configuration",
      "text": "Extra 2027.1 help can be imported with `import --root HELP_PATH --source-id my_help\n--version 2027.1 --kind help --out help.json`. Product source and other help versions are rejected.\nNever publish a corpus containing locally installed product code."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "`npm ci`, `npm run check`, `npm pack`. Maintainers rebuild text assets with:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/build_help.py --source \"2027.1=PATH/Help/Content\"\n```\n\nOnly HTML help body text is extracted; scripts, styles and product source are excluded.\nSee [verification](docs/verification.md), [architecture](docs/architecture.md) and\n[marketplace status](docs/marketplace.md)."
